# ── Shell and pipeline artefacts ──
# These are files created by accident when a redirect or an inline script was
# written for cmd.exe but executed by bash, so the "null device" or a
# format-string fragment became a real filename. Listed individually rather than
# with a wildcard because a wildcard broad enough to catch them would also catch
# legitimate files.
#
#   $null                    -> a `> $null` redirect under bash
#   {dst}')size_mb           -> a broken inline python -c quoting
#   Intestinal / Mouse       -> progress output redirected to a bad filename
$null
{dst}')size_mb
Intestinal
Mouse

# ── Stray JavaScript tooling ──
# The project is Python + Rust; there is no JavaScript build. These came from an
# unrelated experiment and are not part of the build.
